    "rich_text_ywWKpm": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_FRmxPt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Nationwide Reach, Personal Touch",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_97ACwJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our delivery network spans the entire United States, ensuring that your gifts will always arrive fresh and on time. We offer a variety of delivery methods to make this happen:</p><p><strong>Hand-Delivery:</strong> Our dedicated team personally delivers orders to ensure that your arrangement arrives in perfect condition.</p><p><strong>Direct Shipments:</strong> For locations beyond our personal delivery range, we can ship flowers and gifts directly via FedEx. This option brings farm-fresh blooms straight to your doorstep, maintaining the utmost quality and freshness.</p><p><strong>Preferred Local Partners:</strong> In areas where we can't deliver ourselves, we rely on a trusted network of local florists who share our commitment to quality and satisfaction. This ensures that even the most unique orders can be filled with the same level of care that we use ourselves.</p><p>No matter how your order is delivered, it will come with our unwavering 100% satisfaction guarantee. We're dedicated to making sure your experience is nothing short of perfect.</p><h4>Curated Collections for Every Occasion</h4><p>From seasonal collections that celebrate the beauty of the moment to exclusive offerings inspired by current trends and cultural events, our catalog is designed to cater to every occasion. Whether it's a traditional holiday, a personal milestone, or even a nod to pop culture, Kremp Florist has the perfect floral expression.</p><h4>Freshness You Can See and Smell</h4><p>Kremp Florist believes in delivering joy through the freshest flowers. This means that some of our flowers may arrive in bud form, giving your loved ones the special experience of watching them bloom. This ensures that our flowers stay vibrant and fragrant longer.</p><h4>Convenience Meets Elegance</h4><p>Our easy-to-navigate website and streamlined delivery options make choosing and sending the perfect bouquet simple and stress-free. Plus, with services like same-day delivery, we're here to help you make every moment special, even at the last minute.</p><p>At Kremp Florist, we're more than just a flower delivery service; we're your partner in making every occasion memorable. Discover the difference with our curated collections and uncompromising dedication to satisfaction today.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_FRmxPt",
        "text_97ACwJ"
      ],
